<pre></pre>
<table style="background-color: var(--background-color-warning-subtle, #fdf4d8); color: var(--color-base, #202122); border: 2px solid var(--border-color-warning, #DAA520); border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 8px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0; clear: both; margin: 0.5em auto; width: 100%;" dir="ltr" lang="en">
