<p>This image has been assessed under the <i><a href="/wiki/Commons:Valued_image_criteria" title="Commons:Valued image criteria">valued image criteria</a></i> and is considered <b>the most valued image on Commons</b> within the scope: <b><a href="/wiki/Category:Palazzo_Chiericati_(Vicenza)" title="Category:Palazzo Chiericati (Vicenza)">Palazzo Chiericati (Vicenza)</a> - facade on piazza Matteotti</b>. You can see its nomination <a href="/wiki/Commons:Valued_image_candidates/Palazzo_Chiericati_(Vicenza).jpg" title="Commons:Valued image candidates/Palazzo Chiericati (Vicenza).jpg">here</a>.
